WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.500
第 1 集 · 午夜车库
Episode 1 · Midnight Garage

00:00:00.300 --> 00:00:03.450
每个夜晚，他都梦见同一个 看不清脸的女人
Every night, he dreams of a woman whose face he never sees.

00:00:04.200 --> 00:00:08.270
每个夜晚……同样的气味，同样的影子。你到底是谁？
Every night... the same scent. The same shadow. Who are you?

00:00:11.950 --> 00:00:16.330
又是那个梦……我大概是最近太累了。
That dream again... I must be more tired than I thought.

00:00:27.000 --> 00:00:28.000
别动。
Don't move.

00:00:32.400 --> 00:00:33.350
告诉我……
Tell me...

00:00:33.800 --> 00:00:35.070
你到底是从哪里来的？
Where did you come from?

00:00:35.325 --> 00:00:37.625
你：我从地球来的
You: I came from Earth.
（实时生成 · 5+10 · Realtime）

00:00:37.725 --> 00:00:42.581
地球。
Earth.

00:00:44.781 --> 00:00:48.605
那地球一直把你藏着，不让我找到。
Then Earth has been hiding you from me.

00:00:48.805 --> 00:00:52.629
我得确认你是真的。
I need to know you're real.

00:00:52.929 --> 00:00:55.229
你：你想干什么
You: What do you want?
（实时生成 · 5+10 · Realtime）

00:00:55.329 --> 00:01:00.185
就这样。
Just this.

00:01:02.385 --> 00:01:06.209
碰一下就好。我就知道自己不是在做梦。
One touch. Then I'll know I'm not dreaming.

00:01:06.409 --> 00:01:10.233
不在这里。他们来了。跟我走。
Not here. They're coming. Come with me.

00:01:10.333 --> 00:01:12.833
第 2 集 · 车厢里的克制
Episode 2 · The Car

00:01:10.633 --> 00:01:14.553
你：好，我跟你走。但路上，你得把话说清楚。
Fine. I'll come. But you explain on the way.

00:01:16.913 --> 00:01:18.453
开车。
Drive.

00:01:18.533 --> 00:01:21.053
你：你还没告诉我，你到底是什么。
You still haven't told me what you are.

00:01:23.133 --> 00:01:24.843
现在，我身上全是你的气味。
Your scent is on me now.

00:01:25.353 --> 00:01:27.663
午夜之前，那家酒店里的每一头狼都会知道。
Every wolf in that hotel will know it by midnight.

00:01:28.593 --> 00:01:30.443
在我的庄园里，没人能碰你。
At my estate, no one can touch you.

00:01:35.313 --> 00:01:37.603
现在别碰我……我会停不下来。
Don't touch me right now… I won't be able to stop.

00:01:37.683 --> 00:01:37.893
你：你不会伤害我的。
You won't hurt me.

00:01:38.117 --> 00:01:40.417
你：不碰就不碰
You: Fine, I won't touch you.
（实时生成 · 5+10 · Realtime）

00:01:40.517 --> 00:01:45.373
别赌气。
Don't sulk.

00:01:47.573 --> 00:01:51.397
我信不过的不是你，是我自己。
It's not you I don't trust. It's me.

00:01:51.597 --> 00:01:55.421
到了。这是我的领地。
We're here. My territory.

00:01:55.521 --> 00:01:58.021
第 3 集 · 他的领地
Episode 3 · His Territory

00:02:05.881 --> 00:02:07.841
是我的气味。在这里，到处都是。
It's my scent. Here, it's everywhere.

00:02:07.921 --> 00:02:10.771
会好的。我……该提前告诉你。
It'll settle. I… should have warned you.

00:02:19.941 --> 00:02:21.511
这里是我的领地。
This is my territory.

00:02:22.401 --> 00:02:23.301
在这里，没人能碰你。
No one touches you here.

00:02:23.381 --> 00:02:25.401
你：你到底还瞒着我什么？
What else are you hiding?

00:02:27.351 --> 00:02:29.591
你们的世界里，只在故事里听过的东西。
Something your world only tells stories about.

00:02:29.671 --> 00:02:33.821
而你……是我本不该找到的那个人。
And you… are the one thing I was never meant to find.

00:02:34.430 --> 00:02:36.730
你：但你还是找上我了
You: But you still came for me.
（实时生成 · 5+10 · Realtime）

00:02:36.830 --> 00:02:41.686
是。
I did.

00:02:43.886 --> 00:02:47.710
而且我还会再找到你。每一次都会。
And I'd find you again. Every time.

00:02:47.910 --> 00:02:51.734
有人来了。待在我身后。
Someone's here. Stay behind me.

00:02:51.834 --> 00:02:54.334
第 4 集 · 不速之客
Episode 4 · Uninvited

00:02:51.834 --> 00:02:57.314
Arkwright 小姐，他今晚不见任何人。
Miss Arkwright — he's not receiving anyone tonight.

00:02:57.394 --> 00:02:58.484
他会见我的。
He'll receive me.

00:03:06.664 --> 00:03:07.894
待在我身后。
Stay behind me.

00:03:08.944 --> 00:03:16.474
Alpha，Arkwright 小姐来了，她不肯等。
Alpha — Miss Arkwright. She wouldn't wait.

00:03:16.554 --> 00:03:17.404
原来是真的。
So it's true.

00:03:18.754 --> 00:03:20.764
她轮不到你过问，Selene。
She is not your concern, Selene.

00:03:21.794 --> 00:03:23.044
一个人类，Magnus？
A human, Magnus?

00:03:23.654 --> 00:03:25.604
满月之前，长老会会把她带走。
The Council will have her before the full moon.

00:03:28.326 --> 00:03:30.626
你：她说的什么意思
You: What did she mean?
（实时生成 · 5+10 · Realtime）

00:03:30.726 --> 00:03:35.582
意思是，他们知道你了。
It means they know about you.

00:03:37.782 --> 00:03:41.606
长老会会带走一切威胁血脉的东西。今晚，那就是你。
The Council takes whatever threatens the bloodline. Tonight, that's you.

00:03:41.806 --> 00:03:45.630
现在你知道我是什么了。你怕我吗？
Now you know what I am. Are you afraid of me?

00:03:45.730 --> 00:03:48.230
第 5 集 · 不想逃
Episode 5 · I Don't Want to Run

00:03:48.880 --> 00:03:50.750
你：我不是在怕你。
I'm not afraid of you.

00:03:55.320 --> 00:03:56.530
那是什么？
Then what is it?

00:03:57.430 --> 00:03:59.730
你：我只是好奇你和刚才那女的是不是有什么不为人知的往事？
You: I'm just curious. Do you and that woman have some secret past?
（实时生成 · 5+10 · Realtime）

00:03:59.830 --> 00:04:04.686
吃醋了？
Jealous?

00:04:06.886 --> 00:04:10.710
Selene 是我父亲签下的一纸婚约。仅此而已，从来没有别的。
Selene was a contract my father signed. Nothing more. Ever.

00:04:10.910 --> 00:04:14.734
我这辈子找过的，只有一个女人。
There's only one woman I've ever searched for.

00:04:15.034 --> 00:04:17.334
你：你现在看起来不太对劲
You: You don't look right.
（实时生成 · 5+10 · Realtime）

00:04:17.434 --> 00:04:22.290
我是不对劲。
I'm not.

00:04:24.490 --> 00:04:28.314
忍了三十年。而你只差一个呼吸的距离。
Thirty years of holding back. And you're one breath away.

00:04:28.514 --> 00:04:32.338
今晚，别放开我。
Don't let go of me tonight.

00:04:32.438 --> 00:04:34.938
第 6 集 · 今夜
Episode 6 · Tonight

00:04:39.718 --> 00:04:41.008
今晚留下来陪我。
Stay with me tonight.

00:04:41.088 --> 00:04:43.258
你：我哪儿也不去。
I'm not going anywhere.

00:05:10.522 --> 00:05:13.022
第 7 集 · 长老会
Episode 7 · The Council

00:05:10.522 --> 00:05:13.192
Alpha，Harland 召集了长老。
Alpha. Harland has called the elders.

00:05:13.542 --> 00:05:16.172
他们要你把她交给长老会，就在今晚。
They demand you hand her over to the Council. Tonight.

00:05:18.602 --> 00:05:20.392
那就让他们当面听我的答复。
Then they'll hear my answer in person.

00:05:20.806 --> 00:05:23.106
你：你会怎么对他们说
You: What will you tell them?
（实时生成 · 5+10 · Realtime）

00:05:23.206 --> 00:05:28.062
实话。
The truth.

00:05:30.262 --> 00:05:34.086
我找到了我的 Mate。我不会放手。
That I found my Mate. And I'm not giving her up.

00:05:34.286 --> 00:05:38.110
不管代价是什么。让他们来试试。
Whatever it costs. Let them try.

00:05:43.270 --> 00:05:47.500
把她交出来，Magnus。族规比你古老。
Hand her over, Magnus. The law is older than you.

00:05:50.460 --> 00:05:54.230
那这条族规，今晚就到此为止。她是我的 Mate。
Then the law ends tonight. She is my Mate.

00:05:54.320 --> 00:05:57.670
那你就是在向自己的血脉宣战。
Then you have declared war on your own blood.

00:05:58.960 --> 00:06:00.170
那就如此。
So be it.

00:06:00.700 --> 00:06:03.900
第一集 · 完 未完待续
Episode 1 · To be continued
